function ProjectCounts({project,refresh}:{project:string;refresh:number}){ const api=useApi();const[counts,setCounts]=useState<Record<string,number>>();useEffect(()=>{let alive=true;setCounts(undefined);if(project)void api<{counts:Record<string,number>}>('/overview'+query(project)).then(data=>{if(alive)setCounts(data.counts);}).catch(()=>{});return()=>{alive=false;};},[project,refresh]);return counts?<div className="topbar-counts" aria-label={tr("shell.current_project_counts")}><span><Trans i18nKey="shell.count.requirements" values={{count:counts.requirements===undefined?'—':formatNumber(counts.requirements)}} components={{b:<b/>}}/></span><span><Trans i18nKey="shell.count.tasks" values={{count:counts.tasks===undefined?'—':formatNumber(counts.tasks)}} components={{b:<b/>}}/></span></div>:null;}
